    {
      "id": "0b3ceb91-871c-46bf-9866-96e7d0bbf5e9",
      "type": "Output/Note",
      "x": 12,
      "y": -209,
      "w": 640,
      "h": 187,
      "state": {
        "Text": "05 \u2014 SITE MONITOR   (needs internet)\n\nPress Continuous (Ctrl\u002BShift\u002BR); it runs every 5 s.\n\nPings example.com, checks port 443, its TLS certificate (expiry, days left, a \u0022renew soon\u0022 check) and DNS, fetches the page and reads its title. Log, Plot, History, Counter and Previous Value fill up as the run goes on.\n\nSamples 05\u201310 are showcases: each is a set of small, real tasks, one per named group. Collapse the ones you are not reading (double-click a header). Between them the samples use every node type. Values are not saved in the file, so the Outputs start empty.\n\nDelete %TEMP%\\vnoder-showcase* to clean up after 05 and 10."
      }
    }
  ],
