      "y": 0,
      "w": 260,
      "text": "When the page changes (Hash \u2192 Changed \u2192 Run If) this saves a snapshot to %TEMP%\\vnoder-showcase and shows a notification. On the first run that is \u0022snapshot saved\u0022; afterwards only on a change."
